    "task":  "Next: make the Tentacle Cannon (GTFO.Weapons, src/GTFO.Weapons/TentacleCannon.cs + GunInjector.AddTentacleCannon) a wild tentacle-spawning weapon that FANS OUT but does NOT go straight up or down (user, verbatim: \"I don\u0027t know what I want except I want a wild tentacles spawning weapon that fans out but doesnt go straight up or down\"). So: a wide horizontal fan, little vertical spread, wild thrashing - remove/reduce the 12 deg upward Lift and the upward arc bias, keep spread mostly sideways, keep tentacles near aim height. Build, deploy, ask for screenshots.",
    "decisions":  "Mod = GTFO.Weapons (BepInEx IL2CPP, GTFO build 34855). Build+deploy with .\\build.ps1 (only when GTFO.exe not running; DEV profile \"Easy Mode DEV\"). Nothing committed yet - user has not asked to commit. Tentacle Cannon id 1103, special slot, model Buckland XDist2 (gear \"ShotgunRanged\", iron sights) with ShotgunBulletCount=1/no cone, FireMode Auto, ShotDelay 0.235, Damage 10/tentacle stagger x5, infinite ammo, ShellCasingSize 0, kickless recoil, custom hold AddFarLowHold based on vanilla \"Shotgun\" ItemFPSSettings (hip (0.08,-0.105,0.46) zoom (0,-0.175,0.45) rot -3 x, FOV zoom 30). Tentacles: GPUCurvyManager.TryAllocateGPUCurvy(Striker) drawn by TentacleLash (TentacleCannon.cs), m_isVisible forced, points on a snake (two random waves in a random plane, pulse, arc currently 0.4..1.6 upward). Spawn = TentacleCannon.BarrelOnScreen (muzzle reprojected item-camera-\u003eworld camera), SpawnBehind 0.05. Currently Spread 20 deg round cone + Lift 12 deg up; lock cone 15 deg/25 m; no enemy -\u003e SomethingToGrab (flat fan 35 side/8 up-down, 12 m). Lash timings Out 0.04 Hang 0.5 In 0.2. TentaclePool multiplies GPUC_Setup.m_globalLimit (config [Tentacles] PoolMultiplier=4). Shotgun pellets have null owner -\u003e fallback firingWeapon.Owner (SeekerGuns). Other weapons this session: Plasma Pistol(1101 Steigro)/Rifle(1105 Omneco LRG), Hive Pistol(1102 Shelling S49)/Rifle(1104 Malatack HXC) 1 dmg smart-lock, Laser Pistol(1106 Treffen2, hold Pistol_Chunky 48)/Rifle(1107 DEL P1) beams (LaserGuns.cs), Katana = Mastaba blade x7.5 + KatanaDash.cs full-charge dash, Warhammer physical knockback (Knockback.cs), Shadow Dagger stealth+shimmer, Mjolnir thunderclap. /unstuck global command at ~/.claude/commands/unstuck.md + ~/.claude/unstuck.ps1 (stuck-input release fixed dead clicks twice).",
    "state":  "Last action: built+deployed Tentacle Cannon with shotgun-based hold (0 errors). Untested in-game: Katana dash, Warhammer knockback, laser hold/beam offset, tentacle surface-grab/spawn point/new hold. Docs (package/README.md, README.md, package/CHANGELOG.md, shared artifact https://claude.ai/artifact/936ED2nftJqg98PFEQtwKR published from scratchpad gtfo-weapons-arsenal.html) NOT yet updated for: Laser guns, Katana dash, Warhammer knockback, tentacle cannon changes (model/rate/spread/grab/hold); Hive 1 dmg done. Open questions for user: remove brass from Plasma/Laser guns? back up global commands into mindattic-agent-standard (needs user to run /crossrepo mindattic-agent-standard).",
